OL,5,G1300 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FTazamal is used to the effects of
OL,7,     Fhis schizophrenia, but now he has
OL,8,     Fnausea too. Anthony discovered a
OL,9,     Flump in his throat a few months
OL,10,     Fago, and now he is coughing up
OL,11,     Fblood.
OL,12,G1400 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDocumentary series filmed inside a
OL,14,     FBradford GP practice. Jordonna is
OL,15,     Fseverely underweight, so her GP
OL,16,     Fadvises her to eat "full fat
OL,17,     Feverything". Steven has a
OL,18,     Fnasty-looking mole.
